{"id":"d864c52e84a3bb62","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-solovay.md","title":"Solovay's Theorem","display":"thm-solovay — Solovay's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-solovay","aliases":["58-thm-solovay"],"display":"thm-solovay — Solovay's Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-singular]]","[[../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-solovay"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-solovay</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay — Solovay's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"58-df-singular\">58-df-singular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c89f083102fc433\" href=\"?note=0c89f083102fc433\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md\">../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e81c8573f40b6c7\" href=\"?note=2e81c8573f40b6c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md\">../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyCompact},\\mathrm{Sing},\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyCompact},\\mathrm{Sing},\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> are the exact predicates supplied by the cited dependencies</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay} \\vdash \\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{Sing}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\lambda)\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay} \\vdash \\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{Sing}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\lambda)\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Solovay's theorem yields the singular cardinal hypothesis at every singular strong-limit cardinal at or above a strongly compact cardinal.</li>\n<li>The large-cardinal hypothesis is doing substantive work here; the conclusion is not being inferred from a separate assumption of GCH.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-singular","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-singular]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c89f083102fc433","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-strongly-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e81c8573f40b6c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StronglyCompact},\\mathrm{Sing},\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay} \\vdash \\operatorname{StronglyCompact}(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{Sing}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\lambda)\\to2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+","display":true}],"bytes":1038,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4427","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-solovay.md|58-thm-solovay]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","02120307ea943054","0c89f083102fc433","2e81c8573f40b6c7"]}